base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# NekIBM IBM_test/simple: box [-0.02,0.02]^3, inflow uy = 1 at y = -0.02,
# outflow at y = +0.02, periodic x and z; sphere d = 0.01 at the origin
#=======================================================================
Box
-20  -20  -20                                        nelx,nely,nelz
-0.02 0.02 1.                                        x0,x1,ratio
-0.02 0.02 1.                                        y0,y1,ratio
-0.02 0.02 1.                                        z0,z1,ratio
P  ,P  ,v  ,O  ,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
